      "text": "Gradients with transparent stops",
      "level": 2
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "pdfnative 1.8.0 fixed the alpha ramps of COLRv1 gradients: faces, the globe and the cake no longer show a flat opaque fill over their artwork. 👩 👨 🧑 😊 🌍 🎂"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "A toned base outside the bundled set draws the untoned emoji and drops the modifier: 🏃🏽 — never a base followed by a colour swatch."
